      * Regression: RUN with a SECTION entry, guards on multi-line
      * statements with conditional phrases and on a simulated READ,
      * STOP inside a mocked paragraph, GOBACK in a section with a
      * fall-through (documented limit: fall-through is not stopped).
       TESTSUITE TSTSECTS 'sections, multi-line and a simulated file'
       PROGRAM SECTS

       BEFORE-EACH
           MOVE "A" TO WS-MODE
           MOVE ZERO TO WS-STEP WS-COUNT
           MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-TRACE WS-IN-STATUS
           MOCK FILE IN-FILE
               ON READ
                   EVALUATE CBLT-READ-COUNT
                       WHEN 1 MOVE "ONE" TO IN-REC
                       WHEN 2 MOVE "TWO" TO IN-REC
                       WHEN OTHER SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
                   END-EVALUATE
           END-MOCK
       END-BEFORE

       TESTCASE 'normal path: two records, sections run in full'
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-COUNT TO BE NUMERIC 2
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 3
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'DETAIL DONE'
           VERIFY READ IN-FILE HAPPENED 3 TIMES
           VERIFY CLOSE IN-FILE HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'OPEN fails: STOP at the start, nothing after it runs'
           MOCK FILE IN-FILE
               ON OPEN
                   MOVE "35" TO WS-IN-STATUS
               ON READ
                   SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'OPEN FAILED'
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 1
           EXPECT WS-COUNT TO BE ZEROS
           VERIFY READ IN-FILE NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 1000-CHECK NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY CLOSE IN-FILE NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'GOBACK in the section: stops its paragraph and caller'
      * Documented limit: 1100-TAIL still runs because WORK-PART falls
      * through from 1000-CHECK to 1100-TAIL (WS-STEP ends up at 9).
           MOVE "G" TO WS-MODE
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'GOBACK IN SECTION'
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 9
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
           VERIFY CLOSE IN-FILE NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY PARAGRAPH 1100-TAIL HAPPENED ONCE

       TESTCASE 'mocked paragraph with STOP: the original does not run'
           MOCK PARAGRAPH 0000-START
               PERFORM WORK-PART
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-TRACE TO BE 'DETAIL DONE'
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 9
           VERIFY STOP NEVER HAPPENED
           VERIFY READ IN-FILE NEVER HAPPENED

       TESTCASE 'empty file: AT END on the first read'
           MOCK FILE IN-FILE
               ON READ
                   SET CBLT-AT-END TO TRUE
           END-MOCK
           RUN
           EXPECT WS-COUNT TO BE ZEROS
           EXPECT WS-EOF TO BE 'Y'
           EXPECT WS-STEP TO BE NUMERIC 3
           VERIFY STOP HAPPENED ONCE
